---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Admin dashboard preview" description="A visual preview of InfiniCharm's future administration dashboard. It is not protected by login yet.">
  <section class="dashboard-shell container">
    <div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTROL ROOM / PREVIEW</p><h1>Marketplace<br /><span class="coral-text">overview.</span></h1><p class="page-intro">The shape of the future admin workspace: operations, moderation, and marketplace health.</p></div><span class="status-pill"><span></span> UI PREVIEW ONLY</span></div>
    <div class="dashboard-warning"><strong>Security notice</strong><span>This preview is public, has no login, and contains no connected customer or seller records. Never enter credentials or real business data here.</span></div>
    <div class="metric-grid"><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">REGISTERED CUSTOMERS</span><strong>—</strong><span class="metric-footnote">Authentication not connected</span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">SELLERS TO REVIEW</span><strong>—</strong><span class="metric-footnote">Approval workflow not connected</span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">ORDERS TODAY</span><strong>—</strong><span class="metric-footnote">Orders not connected</span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">PLATFORM HEALTH</span><strong class="metric-status">Frontend only</strong><span class="metric-footnote">No live service monitoring</span></article></div>
    <div class="dashboard-content-grid"><section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS</p><h2>Admin work queue</h2></div><span class="mono panel-index">PHASE 2+</span></div><div class="admin-queue-row"><span class="queue-icon">01</span><div><strong>Seller applications</strong><p>Review identity/business information and approve with explicit permissions.</p></div><span class="queue-label">NOT BUILT</span></div><div class="admin-queue-row"><span class="queue-icon">02</span><div><strong>Product moderation</strong><p>Review listings, prohibited items, content quality, and seller ownership.</p></div><span class="queue-label">NOT BUILT</span></div><div class="admin-queue-row"><span class="queue-icon">03</span><div><strong>Order exceptions</strong><p>Investigate cancellations, refunds, disputes, and inventory discrepancies.</p></div><span class="queue-label">NOT BUILT</span></div></section><section class="dashboard-panel dashboard-side-panel"><p class="eyebrow">SECURITY FIRST</p><div class="side-feature-mark">⌘</div><h2>Every action<br />must be traceable.</h2><p>The real admin area will require authentication, server-side authorization, database policies, multi-factor protection where available, and audit logs.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/about/">View project roadmap <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
